{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Jack-O-Lantern is a ",["l","打造","craftable"]," decorative lighting item that can be held or placed to provide light. It can be purchased from ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],"'s booth at the ",["l","万灵节","Spirit's Eve"]," festival for 750g. You can also buy the recipe from the booth for 2,000g."]],["p",["The Jack-O-Lantern influences a radius of approximately 1 tile with dim lighting. It can be placed indoors or outdoors, or in places like ",["l","矿井","the Mines"],". It can be removed by striking it with a ",["l","锄头","Hoe"],", a ",["l","十字镐","Pickaxe"],", or an ",["l","斧头","Axe"],". Unlike the braziers, which can toggle on and off, the Jack-O-Lantern is always on. They provide the least light out of all craftable lighting sources."]],["p",["On the 17th of ",["l","秋季","Fall"],", after the ",["l","星露谷展览会","Stardew Valley Fair"],", Jack-o-Lanterns appear in front of the following locations: ",["l","柳巷1号","1 Willow Lane"]," (Jodi, Kent, Sam, and Vincent), ",["l","柳巷2号","2 Willow Lane"]," (Haley and Emily), ",["l","河间大道1号","1 River Road"]," (Evelyn George, and Alex), ",["l","木匠的商店","Carpenter's Shop"]," (Robin, Demetrius, Maru, and Sebastian), and the ",["l","拖车","Trailer"]," (Pam and Penny)."]],["p",["On the 1st of ",["l","冬季","Winter"],", the Jack-O-Lantern turns into a ",["l","腐烂的植物","Rotten Plant"]," (unless stored in a ",["l","宝箱","chest"]," or ",["l","物品栏","inventory"],")."]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Dislike"]},[["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","哈维","Harvey"],", ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"],", ",["l","威利","Willy"],", ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"]]]]]]],["Bundles",2,[["p",["The Jack-O-Lantern is used in the Spirit's Eve Bundle."]]]],["Tailoring",2,[["p",["The Jack-O-Lantern is used in the spool of the ",["l","柳巷2号#Sewing Machine","Sewing Machine"]," to create the ",["i","(H)48","Pumpkin Mask"],". It can be used in ",["l","染色","dyeing"],", serving as an orange dye at the dye pots, located in ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],"'s and ",["l","海莉","Haley"],"'s house, ",["l","柳巷2号","2 Willow Lane"],"."]]]],["Quests",2,[["p",["The Jack-O-Lantern is not used in any ",["l","任务","quests"],"."]]]],["Notes",2,[["p",["The amount of illumination it gives off is less than a ",["l","火把","Torch"],". This may make it more useful as a decorative piece than as night-time lighting."]]]],["History",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","版本历史#1.4","1.4"],": Can now be used in ",["l","裁缝","Tailoring"],"."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.6","1.6"],": Added jack-o-lanterns after the ",["l","星露谷展览会","Stardew Valley Fair"]," in fall around the Valley. Is now used in the Spirit's Eve Bundle."]]]]]]],"f":[["Source",[["l","打造","Crafting"]," • ",["l","万灵节","Spirit's Eve"]]],["Ingredients",[["i","(O)276","Pumpkin ×1"],["i","(O)93","Torch ×1"]]],["Sell Price",["0g"]]]}